# Note / Richtext (new)

Purpose: free-form words on the canvas — announcements, runbooks,
"how to read this dashboard". Exists because data without narrative
is ambiguous; the note is where a human explains intent. Reuses the
TipTap richtext substrate.

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

| Option | Category | Relevancy | Values / default | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| title | display | 🔥 | text / hidden | note can be title-less |
| content | data | 🔥 | richtext doc ({doc,text} envelope) | the body itself |
| appearance | display | ⭐ | plain / callout (info/warn/success) | tinted background |
| editing | display | ⭐ | inline on canvas / modal only | who-can-edit follows dashboard perms |
| overflow | display | ⭐ | clip + fade / scroll | fixed tile, long text |
| padding | layout | 💤 | normal / tight | |
| icon | display | 💤 | icon name / none | |
| attribution | display | 💤 | off / author + updated footer | |
| filters | filter | — | none — static content | |
